{"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"<CHEATSHEET_V0>"},{"role":"user","content":"Build me a two-step workflow in flows: a research step that asks a model to research a topic and hands back a typed { summary, keyPoints } result, then a writing step that turns that research into a short article with a word count. Both steps must be model calls with enforced output schemas, and the whole thing has to run in CI against a scripted model with no API key."},{"role":"assistant","content":"/**
