{"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"<CHEATSHEET_V0>"},{"role":"user","content":"Build a flows pipeline that extracts a structured entity from raw text and optional file paths: a name, a type (person, company, product, event, document, or other), and a list of key-value fields, each with a confidence score between 0 and 1. Then validate the extracted fields, marking each valid or invalid and correcting anything under 0.9 confidence, and compute an overall confidence. Finally forward only the valid fields as a flattened key-value record, tagged with the name of the next pipeline step, for downstream consumption."},{"role":"assistant","content":"/**
